// Rust TerminalPolicy owns TerminalSize by value (CommonTypes.rs:57-59).
// Embedded Size@0 is byte-identical to the 16-byte TerminalSize carrier.
// Ctor consumes/frees its input Size once; getter owns a fresh Size allocation.
